{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-09-24T14:49:00.490Z","data":{"text":"Done. Summary of the work:\n\n**Implemented** `src/runtime/docker.ts` — the dockerode 4 `DockerRuntime` adapter (the only module importing dockerode), covering:\n- `ping` (docker/podman detection via version components)\n- `pullImage` with `modem.followProgress`, stream/event errors, 404 and Podman-500 → `ImageNotFoundError`\n- `createContainer` exact Docker body, 409 → `NameConflictError`, 404 → `ImageNotFoundError`\n- start/stop 304-as-success, 404 → `ContainerNotFoundError`, `t`/`force` passthrough\n- `inspectContainer`/`listContainers` state and time mapping\n- `containerLogs` demux + millisecond `since`/`tail`\n- `ensureNetwork`/`ensureVolume`/`networkExists`/`removeLabelled`\n- socket errors → `RuntimeUnavailableError`, cause preserved everywhere\n\n**Tests**: `tests/docker-runtime.test.ts` (one test per acceptance line, with a hand-written Docker stub) and `tests/integration/docker.itest.ts` (skipped without `PAAS_INTEGRATION=1`, otherwise contract suite). Added the exact `test:integration` script to `package.json`.\n\nBoth verifications pass:\n- task verify `node --import tsx --test tests/docker-runtime.test.ts tests/integration/docker.itest.ts` → exit 0 (25 pass, 1 skipped)\n- proposal verify `pnpm verify` → exit 0 (263 tests)\n\nResult written to `openspec/changes/007-docker-podman-adapter/.run/results/3.md`."}}
